WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:42.600 --> 01:43.930
I'm so hungry!

01:44.200 --> 01:46.830
It's winter break and we
still had to practice all day.

01:47.540 --> 01:48.470
What's going on?

01:49.040 --> 01:52.130
I was checking my weight because I'm on a diet.

01:52.410 --> 01:56.640
I thought maybe my appetite would go
away if I weighed myself before lunch.

01:56.910 --> 02:01.040
Oh, right. We had a physical before the break.

02:01.420 --> 02:05.150
I ate cake during Christmas so
maybe I gained some weight.

02:05.450 --> 02:06.850
Mind if I try?

02:10.430 --> 02:12.260
I gained 2 kg!

02:12.860 --> 02:15.020
Can I try, too?

02:15.760 --> 02:16.460
Go ahead.

02:22.600 --> 02:23.570
What's the verdict?

02:23.570 --> 02:24.970
D-Don't look!

02:34.720 --> 02:39.650
Our Fox Deity, Goes on a Diet

02:39.720 --> 02:43.730
Why? Why did my weight skyrocket like that?!

02:43.730 --> 02:46.660
I guess I ate some cake with
friends during Christmas...

02:46.660 --> 02:49.100
Then I ate some cake with the badminton club...

02:49.100 --> 02:51.220
And I guess I ate some cake at home, too...

03:01.580 --> 03:04.510
Yeah, that's the worst time to do it.

03:05.550 --> 03:06.610
What's up, Sakura?

03:07.780 --> 03:09.720
Boys are so lucky...

03:10.150 --> 03:10.880
Why?

03:10.990 --> 03:15.220
Because you eat so much but you never get fat!

03:15.420 --> 03:19.760
I'd like to know why you get fat just
from a little food here and there.

03:19.760 --> 03:20.690
Yeah.

03:21.030 --> 03:24.060
Don't say that in front of a girl!

03:24.800 --> 03:26.860
S-Sorry...

03:26.970 --> 03:29.870
I think girls worry too much
about what it says on the scale.

03:29.870 --> 03:32.030
What? We can't help it.

03:32.710 --> 03:34.440
How much do you weigh, Takagami?

03:35.410 --> 03:37.080
What do you care how much I weigh?

03:37.080 --> 03:38.980
Don't you want to know, Sakura?

03:39.250 --> 03:40.740
Y-Yes, I do!

03:41.720 --> 03:44.150
I want to know anything about Takagami!

03:44.550 --> 03:47.750
I think I'm about 55 kg, maybe?

03:48.320 --> 03:49.880
What's with those numbers?

03:50.260 --> 03:51.920
What do you mean by that?

03:52.130 --> 03:54.360
Don't tell me, Sakura...

03:54.900 --> 03:56.830
You're heavier than Takagami?

03:57.100 --> 03:59.430
N-N-No way!

03:59.970 --> 04:03.030
I'm not, but I'm not that much lighter either...

04:03.640 --> 04:07.940
Considering our difference in height,
it makes my weight feel even worse.

04:13.350 --> 04:14.750
There you are!

04:16.050 --> 04:17.310
Noboru-kun!

04:19.050 --> 04:20.780
You seem to be working hard at practice.

04:20.960 --> 04:22.420
Here's a little something for you.

04:22.520 --> 04:25.580
They're pork buns. Go ahead and share them.

04:25.930 --> 04:27.550
Th-Thanks.

04:27.860 --> 04:29.390
Have some if you like, Misaki-chan.

04:30.570 --> 04:32.290
Isn't practice over already?

04:32.470 --> 04:33.560
Why don't we go somewhere?

04:33.970 --> 04:38.530
There's this really good cheesecake
place that just opened by the bookstore.

04:39.510 --> 04:40.910
Sorry, not today.

04:41.080 --> 04:41.910
Oh.

04:42.610 --> 04:43.840
Sorry for asking you out of the blue.

04:44.250 --> 04:44.800
Here.

04:45.450 --> 04:46.000
Thanks.

04:46.510 --> 04:48.380
I'll see you later.

04:49.520 --> 04:53.920
What the hell is wrong with you?
How could you turn down Miyabe-san?!

04:54.160 --> 04:57.530
Toru asked me to make him
stuffed cabbage tonight.

04:57.530 --> 04:59.130
That's why?

04:59.130 --> 05:00.960
You know how much of
a hassle it is to make?

05:01.030 --> 05:03.050
Poor Miyabe-san.

05:03.560 --> 05:05.560
Maybe she has a thing for Takagami.

05:05.670 --> 05:07.790
What? No way.

05:07.940 --> 05:09.930
N-No way...

05:10.310 --> 05:13.900
Look at those legs...

05:16.380 --> 05:19.210
She's so pretty...

05:20.320 --> 05:25.080
Maybe Takagami likes slim girls
more than big-boned ones...

05:26.050 --> 05:29.960
What should I do?
If he found out about my weight now...

05:30.190 --> 05:32.350
He might think I'm a fatty.

05:32.530 --> 05:33.760
Oh, Sakura.

05:33.760 --> 05:34.690
Yes?

05:34.960 --> 05:37.020
Do you want some pork buns?

05:37.270 --> 05:38.900
No! I don't want any!

05:38.900 --> 05:40.630
I'm definitely not eating them!

05:46.940 --> 05:48.410
Pork buns aren't bad!

05:48.540 --> 05:51.940
I've wanted to try them ever
since I went to Ebisu's store!

05:52.550 --> 05:56.210
There are also red bean buns, curry buns,
and pizza buns. They are all delicious.

05:59.150 --> 06:00.520
I'm full.

06:00.960 --> 06:02.010
I'm home.

06:02.160 --> 06:04.390
Want some pork buns, Noboru?

06:05.130 --> 06:06.560
Pork buns again?

06:06.560 --> 06:08.760
Wait, why did you buy so many of them?!

06:09.230 --> 06:12.170
Guess what? They're all different kinds!

06:12.170 --> 06:13.960
Here's the mixed pork bun...

06:14.100 --> 06:15.700
And here's the braised pork bun...

06:15.700 --> 06:18.540
You're going to put us in
the red this month again!

06:19.170 --> 06:21.810
Besides, you'll get fat if you eat that much.

06:21.810 --> 06:25.510
Don't worry about that. I can't get fat!

06:26.050 --> 06:30.250
Um, I think I gained some
weight since moving here.

06:30.390 --> 06:31.690
Really?

06:31.690 --> 06:32.520
Yes...

06:32.720 --> 06:34.850
Why don't you get on the scale then?

06:37.930 --> 06:38.720
Well?

06:39.030 --> 06:44.260
I do not know my previous weight,
so I cannot tell if I gained any.

06:44.500 --> 06:50.460
Oh, then you can input your height here
and find out if you're over or underweight.

06:50.740 --> 06:53.330
Let's see. Ko's height is...

06:53.880 --> 06:55.170
This should be about right.

06:55.840 --> 06:57.330
Try getting on again.

06:57.710 --> 06:58.470
Sure.

07:00.350 --> 07:01.870
"Somewhat overweight."

07:02.050 --> 07:04.480
That's what you get for eating snacks like earlier.

07:04.950 --> 07:07.110
No snacks for both of you until I say so.

07:07.590 --> 07:08.990
It'll help the family budget, too.

07:09.090 --> 07:10.150
What?!

07:19.570 --> 07:21.330
I did get heavier...

07:21.800 --> 07:23.770
And New Year's Day is coming up, too.

07:23.770 --> 07:28.210
I'll be eating osechi and zoni. To top it off,
I always stop exercising this time of year...

07:29.140 --> 07:31.480
I have to drop my weight now!

07:33.150 --> 07:35.150
I'm cutting down my usual intake to half!

07:35.150 --> 07:36.280
No snacking!

07:36.280 --> 07:39.150
Avoid carbs and fats as much as possible!

07:39.150 --> 07:42.120
My current goal is to lose 3 kg!

07:49.160 --> 07:52.170
I'll run and run to drop my weight...

07:52.170 --> 07:55.900
I'll get myself slender legs like Miyabe-san has!

07:58.040 --> 07:59.510
Hey, it's Sakura.

07:59.710 --> 08:01.640
She seems pumped up.

08:05.150 --> 08:06.780
You're up early, Sakura.

08:06.780 --> 08:07.540
What?

08:07.780 --> 08:08.510
Yeah!

08:08.720 --> 08:10.270
You look like you're working hard.

08:12.290 --> 08:14.750
I can't say it's for my diet...

08:15.260 --> 08:17.880
Oh, yeah. Do you want to
come with us after school?

08:18.690 --> 08:21.490
Takagami is asking me out!

08:22.000 --> 08:25.230
We're talking about going to an
all-you-can-eat BBQ restaurant later.

08:25.670 --> 08:26.390
BBQ?

08:26.670 --> 08:29.030
I'm not going! I'm never going!

08:29.470 --> 08:31.170
I'm definitely not going!

08:32.270 --> 08:33.500
Oh, okay...

08:38.310 --> 08:40.680
Hi, Tenko-san and Ko-chan.

08:40.950 --> 08:43.750
What are you reading with
that scowl on your face?

08:43.950 --> 08:46.010
Just some stuff...

08:46.720 --> 08:49.750
What kind of books are you here for?

08:49.960 --> 08:52.860
We're going to make the Mamorime
do this thing called a diet.

08:53.130 --> 08:53.590
What?!

08:54.130 --> 08:57.120
We came to find out how
you can do this dieting thing.

08:57.300 --> 08:59.160
I am "somewhat overweight."

08:59.600 --> 09:02.900
That is why Noboru-sama
forbade us to snack anymore...

09:03.640 --> 09:05.800
He's forcing Ko-chan to go on a diet?

09:06.210 --> 09:08.640
Now I know for sure Takagami likes thinner girls!

09:09.080 --> 09:12.480
On top of that, Ko-chan is trying
to lose weight for Takagami.

09:12.610 --> 09:16.050
Excuse me, but are you trying to diet, too?

09:17.150 --> 09:19.850
Did you get fat from all the snacking?

09:20.290 --> 09:22.620
Please don't say that.

09:25.630 --> 09:28.150
I have to lose weight no matter what!

09:28.400 --> 09:31.230
Cutting back on calories is a given,
but what else can I do?

09:32.930 --> 09:34.830
I smell something sweet.

09:35.240 --> 09:36.670
You're right.

09:37.870 --> 09:40.930
It's the cheesecake store
Miyabe-san was talking about.

09:41.140 --> 09:43.630
Cheesecake? Sounds good!

09:43.740 --> 09:45.180
No snacking.

09:46.250 --> 09:48.110
Then hurry up with your diet!

09:48.350 --> 09:50.580
Or else I'll never get to eat any snacks!

09:51.690 --> 09:54.450
We're having a promotional
trial period free of charge!

09:54.860 --> 09:56.190
A gym...

09:56.690 --> 09:57.620
L-Look!

09:58.060 --> 10:00.030
"Give yourself that fit body you want!"

10:01.030 --> 10:02.660
What do you do on this?

10:03.000 --> 10:04.330
You run on top of it.

10:04.570 --> 10:06.400
On top of this?

10:06.700 --> 10:10.230
Yeah. You run to burn those calories!

10:10.500 --> 10:13.030
Is that how you diet?

10:13.270 --> 10:14.670
Theoretically, yes!

10:15.010 --> 10:16.910
I shall try.

10:17.650 --> 10:18.610
Let me see...

10:19.080 --> 10:19.740
Here you go!

10:23.550 --> 10:24.640
Watch out!

10:25.220 --> 10:26.850
The ground is moving.

10:27.420 --> 10:29.980
You can lower the speed here.

10:32.860 --> 10:34.900
I just have to eat less and exercise.

10:34.900 --> 10:37.830
I should eventually get
thinner and nicer legs then.

10:38.470 --> 10:39.900
You can do this, Misaki!

10:42.870 --> 10:44.900
This feels really meaningless.

10:53.580 --> 10:54.980
I'm so sorry.

10:55.720 --> 10:59.210
All right! Now to burn some
calories by swimming!

10:59.420 --> 11:01.850
You can diet by swimming?

11:02.120 --> 11:03.180
If you try hard enough, yeah.

11:03.520 --> 11:05.890
I have never swam before.

11:06.030 --> 11:09.800
You'll be fine. You just have
to paddle your arms and legs.

11:09.800 --> 11:11.920
I want to try the jacuzzi.

11:14.200 --> 11:15.400
I'm going on ahead.

11:15.640 --> 11:16.190
Sure.

11:24.580 --> 11:29.880
I can manipulate water,
but moving in the water is hard...

11:39.930 --> 11:42.620
I cannot breathe...

11:49.500 --> 11:52.530
What just happened?

11:54.840 --> 11:58.010
Oh, no. I used a spell without thinking ahead.

12:11.530 --> 12:13.150
What was that anyway?

12:13.460 --> 12:15.790
How did all the water just disappear?

12:16.030 --> 12:17.050
I apologize.

12:17.900 --> 12:19.460
It's not your fault.

12:20.500 --> 12:21.870
Hey, Noboru!

12:22.440 --> 12:23.330
Hey!

12:23.470 --> 12:27.580
There's a real appetizing smell coming off of you.

12:27.580 --> 12:30.440
I, uh, went to this all-you-can-eat BBQ place...

12:30.440 --> 12:31.500
By yourself?!

12:31.650 --> 12:33.880
I get hungry after practice!

12:33.880 --> 12:37.040
Take me there! I want to go, too!

12:37.180 --> 12:39.080
Don't you guys want to go, too?!

12:39.490 --> 12:41.520
I am on a diet...

12:41.520 --> 12:44.180
Yeah, you have to cut back on calories...

12:44.430 --> 12:46.360
Then what are we supposed to eat?

12:46.690 --> 12:49.420
I think it's better to eat
mainly vegetable dishes...

12:49.830 --> 12:55.540
But it's better to have some protein,
so you need some tofu or lean fish...

12:55.540 --> 12:57.000
You seem to know a lot, Sakura.

12:58.040 --> 13:01.270
Come stay over at our place!

13:01.510 --> 13:03.170
We'll do a dieting camp!

13:03.940 --> 13:04.970
That is a great idea.

13:06.080 --> 13:08.480
Can I sleep over?

13:08.780 --> 13:12.280
I don't see why not. As long
as it's okay with your family...

13:13.990 --> 13:17.050
Sleeping over at Takagami's home?! No way!

13:21.600 --> 13:23.690
I'll be living under the same roof as Takagami!

13:26.170 --> 13:27.530
Take this with you.

13:29.600 --> 13:31.260
Your lucky panties!

13:34.810 --> 13:37.040
Th-That's not why I'm going there!

13:37.650 --> 13:39.140
But I'll take them anyway...

13:42.880 --> 13:45.180
What's with that huge bag, Misaki?

13:46.020 --> 13:47.040
Just some stuff...

13:49.590 --> 13:50.960
See you later!

13:52.530 --> 13:53.990
Sakura, let me carry it for you.

13:54.760 --> 13:55.790
Thanks.

13:57.670 --> 13:59.630
What's up, Sakura? Are you going on a trip?

13:59.630 --> 14:01.570
No, she's sleeping over at my place.

14:03.340 --> 14:04.710
What the hell?!

14:04.710 --> 14:06.300
When did you two get so close?!

14:06.770 --> 14:10.730
Tenko-san at Takagami's place asked me to.

14:10.910 --> 14:13.400
Yeah, they said it's kind of like a camp.

14:17.480 --> 14:18.950
It's like they're in two different worlds...

14:19.190 --> 14:21.180
When is he going to notice?

14:25.730 --> 14:28.730
Oh yeah. I have to go shopping for dinner.

14:28.730 --> 14:30.220
I guess so.

14:30.600 --> 14:31.830
Let's stop by the supermarket.

14:32.800 --> 14:35.740
That sounded like a conversation
between a married couple!

14:36.500 --> 14:38.100
Hey, the daikon radish is cheap!

14:38.810 --> 14:40.740
I could stew a yellowtail with it tonight.

14:40.740 --> 14:42.040
That sounds good!

14:42.240 --> 14:46.510
It feels like we really might end up together!

14:49.750 --> 14:51.840
Is there anything I can help with, Sakura?

14:52.190 --> 14:53.410
No, I'll be fine.

14:53.620 --> 14:55.920
Do you mind if I go take a bath first?

14:56.160 --> 14:56.850
Go ahead.

14:57.360 --> 15:00.190
I'm so glad I'm on a diet!

15:00.430 --> 15:02.220
I'm so glad I got fat!

15:02.300 --> 15:04.320
When's the food going to be done, Sakura?

15:04.770 --> 15:06.530
Is there anything I can do?

15:06.670 --> 15:09.360
No, let me do it! I want to do it all by myself!

15:14.910 --> 15:16.840
Wow, this is good!

15:16.840 --> 15:18.070
It's healthy, too!

15:18.680 --> 15:21.270
You should live here, Sakura!

15:21.550 --> 15:22.910
That's not happening.

15:23.550 --> 15:25.280
But I wouldn't mind it...

15:26.750 --> 15:28.310
Do you want seconds, Takagami?

15:28.420 --> 15:29.680
Yes, please.

15:31.830 --> 15:34.950
I love this feeling.

15:35.200 --> 15:35.850
Sakura?

15:36.430 --> 15:37.690
Uh, my seconds...

15:39.130 --> 15:40.100
Sorry!

15:41.500 --> 15:42.900
What about you, Ko-chan?

15:44.510 --> 15:47.500
I am currently on a diet.

15:48.440 --> 15:50.140
R-Right...

15:50.440 --> 15:52.380
I forgot I'm on it, too!

15:52.750 --> 15:54.280
Misaki-sama...

15:54.280 --> 15:55.270
Yes?

15:55.850 --> 16:00.050
Can you teach me how to make
this diet food later tonight?

16:00.620 --> 16:03.090
Ko-chan is so motivated!

16:03.320 --> 16:05.550
Is she doing it for Takagami?

16:11.630 --> 16:13.600
I have to try harder!

16:26.350 --> 16:29.150
Do I have to cut back on even more calories?

16:32.390 --> 16:33.550
Sorry, Sakura!

16:34.690 --> 16:35.960
He saw me!

16:35.960 --> 16:38.980
He saw my flabby tummy and legs!

16:42.760 --> 16:45.560
Sorry about that, Sakura.

16:45.870 --> 16:47.600
It's all right...

16:47.970 --> 16:49.800
I thought Toru was in there.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.270
Takagami.

16:51.710 --> 16:52.260
Yeah?

16:52.710 --> 16:55.040
You didn't see anything, right?

16:55.810 --> 16:56.800
My...

16:57.040 --> 17:00.310
I didn't! I didn't see anything!

17:00.310 --> 17:01.440
G-Good night!

17:05.490 --> 17:06.480
I can't do this...

17:06.850 --> 17:09.250
Even if I'm living under the
same roof as Takagami...

17:09.720 --> 17:13.850
...it doesn't feel romantic when I have this body.

17:17.830 --> 17:20.100
I'm hungry...

17:20.400 --> 17:23.560
I didn't eat much of the stuff I cooked...

17:26.710 --> 17:29.610
A hamburger steak with demi-glace sauce...

17:32.450 --> 17:35.510
Pizza with extra cheese...

17:40.750 --> 17:42.780
A thick, juicy steak...

17:46.460 --> 17:49.450
My favorite potato chips...

17:52.130 --> 17:54.900
I won't eat any of them!

17:59.170 --> 18:01.540
This is going to be the last practice of the year.

18:01.540 --> 18:02.010
Yup!

18:09.680 --> 18:11.280
What happened, Misaki?!

18:11.620 --> 18:12.950
Did you get fatter again?

18:13.320 --> 18:14.950
N-No...

18:16.290 --> 18:18.450
I reached my goal!

18:18.960 --> 18:20.460
I did it! I did it!

18:20.460 --> 18:23.860
This is great!

18:27.430 --> 18:29.870
But I better make sure I don't rebound.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.410
Here I go!

18:32.410 --> 18:38.350
That means I still can't eat my
favorite fried foods and cake just yet!

18:39.510 --> 18:41.550
Hey, want to go for some pizza?

18:41.550 --> 18:42.480
I'll go!

18:43.720 --> 18:44.840
I'll pass.

18:45.150 --> 18:47.120
What?! You're not going?!

18:47.450 --> 18:48.010
Yeah...

18:48.260 --> 18:50.690
You do look kind of pale.

18:50.990 --> 18:52.690
Be careful on your way home, okay?

18:52.890 --> 18:53.790
Bye.

18:59.870 --> 19:01.360
I'm hungry...

19:05.410 --> 19:07.030
Sakura, are you okay?

19:07.670 --> 19:08.800
Takagami...

19:12.250 --> 19:14.210
You don't look so good.

19:14.520 --> 19:16.020
I'm fine...

19:16.020 --> 19:17.640
What are you saying...

19:18.490 --> 19:19.080
Sakura!

19:20.090 --> 19:21.920
What's wrong? Are you sick?

19:22.620 --> 19:25.320
I think I'm dizzy...

19:25.930 --> 19:28.590
Did you catch a cold? Maybe you have a fever.

19:30.100 --> 19:31.160
Well...

19:37.240 --> 19:40.040
D-Did he hear that?!

19:40.370 --> 19:42.240
That's so embarrassing!

19:42.380 --> 19:44.210
Uh, Sa...

19:44.210 --> 19:46.380
It's not what it seems!

19:46.380 --> 19:49.220
My stomach just woke up right now!

19:49.220 --> 19:51.790
Maybe it's the sound of a catfish causing a
huge earthquake and we're at the epicenter!?

19:51.790 --> 19:54.350
My breathing from the abdomen
caused a natural disaster!

19:54.350 --> 19:55.320
Are you hungry?

19:56.290 --> 19:58.950
Maybe, but I'm not!

20:00.590 --> 20:01.690
Want to go eat something together?

20:01.800 --> 20:04.890
That'll anger the earthquake-causing catfish!

20:06.500 --> 20:10.370
You know that cheesecake place
near the bookstore?

20:10.470 --> 20:14.030
I want to try it out, but it feels weird
when a man goes in there alone.

20:14.210 --> 20:15.310
But I...

20:15.310 --> 20:17.440
Do you hate sweets?

20:18.510 --> 20:20.740
Oh, I get it. You're short on cash.

20:21.980 --> 20:23.480
Oh, fine.

20:23.480 --> 20:27.980
I don't have much on me, but it's my treat.
It's to thank you for making dinner.

20:34.460 --> 20:36.260
You don't even know what I'm agonizing over...

20:37.730 --> 20:38.530
What?

20:41.500 --> 20:43.830
You're always like this, Takagami.

20:43.970 --> 20:46.030
So you're not going?

20:48.640 --> 20:51.270
I want to go! I really want to go!

20:55.220 --> 20:56.650
This is so good!

20:56.850 --> 20:58.510
Yeah, it is.

20:59.320 --> 21:00.810
So Takagami...

21:01.020 --> 21:05.190
Do you hate girls who eat a lot?

21:05.460 --> 21:10.730
Maybe if they go overboard,
but I like anyone who really enjoys their food.

21:12.200 --> 21:13.390
Oh...

21:14.330 --> 21:15.890
I guess so!

21:16.870 --> 21:18.270
Still...

21:19.470 --> 21:22.930
I haven't heard anyone's
stomach growl that loud in years!

21:57.240 --> 22:02.510
Hare mo ke mo naku oowarawa de neboketerarenai
With all the commotion, I can't stay still.

22:03.020 --> 22:08.550
Kidoairaku gochamaze aa ijou
With emotions running wild,
everything seems so odd.

22:08.860 --> 22:14.350
Inochimijikashi toiunonara hara wo kukutte
Life is short so be prepared for anything.

22:14.660 --> 22:19.720
Iran kyoukai nanno sono yuke
Transcend that useless boundary and go!

22:19.800 --> 22:20.430
Kitsune Soba

22:20.830 --> 22:26.500
kingin kagayaku suteki na mainichi
With those bright days behind you,

22:26.640 --> 22:32.440
omatsurisawagi de mairouka
It's time for some merrymaking.

22:33.010 --> 22:38.850
Sora ni hi wo tomoshi tamashii no pareedo
Light the skies for this parade of souls,

22:38.990 --> 22:44.720
shiawase no kotodama hora kousa suru
The kotodama of happiness crosses paths.

22:44.860 --> 22:50.460
Namida mo wasurete odori odore
Forget those tears and dance away,

22:50.700 --> 22:56.600
toriaezu iiyone tanoshikeryasa
Forget about everything else
since we're having fun now.

23:05.310 --> 23:06.400
How is it?

23:06.550 --> 23:08.450
Not much has changed.

23:08.820 --> 23:10.310
Even after all that dieting...

23:14.890 --> 23:18.190
Of course it'd weigh you
down if you carried all this!

23:25.000 --> 23:25.670
Next Time

23:25.670 --> 23:27.930
Next Time
My sibling is here again.

23:27.930 --> 23:28.000
Next Time

23:28.000 --> 23:30.940
Next Time
It will never forgive the
clan who sealed me away.

23:30.940 --> 23:31.000
Next Time

23:31.000 --> 23:33.770
Next Time
Will I be able to soften its stubborn heart?

23:33.770 --> 23:34.140
Next Time

23:34.140 --> 23:35.240
Next Time
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Goes
to the New Year's Festival."

23:35.240 --> 23:36.580
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to the New Year's Festival
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Goes
to the New Year's Festival."

23:36.580 --> 23:36.780
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to the New Year's Festival

23:36.780 --> 23:39.450
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to the New Year's Festival
I want to pray for these
peaceful days to continue.

23:39.450 --> 23:39.940
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to the New Year's Festival
